# ------------------------------------------------------------
# CTS REFERENCE CELLS
#
# Use only ordinary HVT buffers/inverters.
# Avoid input buffers, tri-state buffers and very large X32
# drivers for this small 128-register clock tree.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
